OL,3,ARaheem Sterling given suspended jail   
OL,4,Asentence for dangerous driving and     
OL,5,Anitrous oxide possession               
OL,7,FDistrict Judge Kirsty Allman has       
OL,8,Fdescribed the footballer's decision to 
OL,9,Fdrive "without adequate sleep" and     
OL,10,Fwhilst consuming nitrous oxide as      
OL,11,F"entirely selfish"                     
OL,13,FSterling - who doesn't currently belong
OL,14,Fto a club - has 82 England caps, the   
OL,15,Flast of which was won at the 2022 World
OL,16,FCup                                    
